   - Return fresh copies so callers cannot mutate store state.
3. Routes (APIRouter prefix /mock) in main.py: GET /mock/projects/{code} (404 error shape PROJECT_NOT_FOUND if missing), GET /mock/policy, GET /mock/reports?employee_id= which returns 403 FORBIDDEN unless employee_id equals the session employee. DO NOT create any POST/PUT/DELETE route under /mock or anywhere that reaches the write functions.
