## Appendix: quick troubleshooting for the build machine

| Symptom | Likely cause | Fix |
|---|---|---|
| Receipts fail with DATE_TOO_OLD | Today is after 27 Dec 2026, so the 28-30 Oct 2026 receipts are older than 60 days (correct behaviour) | Re-date the test receipts to within the last 60 days |
| `python run.py` fails on npm | Node not installed or not on PATH | Install Node 18+, reopen the terminal |
| Extraction returns odd JSON | Model not supporting structured outputs | Use `gpt-4o-mini` or `gpt-4o` |
| Cookie not kept by test script | Missing cookie jar | Use `httpx.Client()` (one client for all calls) |
| Token counts missing in logs | Reading `usage` from the wrong object | Use `response.usage.prompt_tokens` / `completion_tokens` |
| Flaky LLM-dependent test | Non-deterministic output | Keep `temperature=0`, retry up to 2 times, note "flaky" in results |
